nd her photos look beautiful! \u00a0 She also recommended him to me for videography. \u00a0Our photographer will be travelling with us, so we won't need to book her.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for the reply.. and Congrats !!!! \u00a0Enjoy your wedding day !\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bthomps1203@aol.com","IpAddress":"96.90.48.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462822254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BritML0121","Id":286907,"Name":"BritML0121","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.98.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80086,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee2a9e3a72a3d8b6f587d653b3d012fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BritML0121\"] Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please feel free to check our work &amp;amp; reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jamaica Video&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/youtu.be\/NB6I-8jRdiQ&#039;&gt;https:\/\/youtu.be\/NB6I-8jRdiQ&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18203]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Reviews&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.facebook.com\/DreamArtPhotographyReviews&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.facebook.com\/DreamArtPhotographyWeddings&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914436,"PostDate":1466179300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n             