{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.84.198.154","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81115,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1985995a2517ab38ab2b5a69e06c2b82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;A picture is worth a thousand words, so before I praise Christopher at ZulusPro with more than a thousand words, I&amp;nbsp;implore future brides to go to his website and experience his artwork for themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:#000080;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.zulusproweddings.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.zulusproweddings.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;Nothing is more stressful than planning a wedding. Every bride wants \"their\" day to be perfect and although we go through every obstacle to try to make it perfect, there&#039;s no&amp;nbsp;guarantee. The details of my wedding felt \"up in the air\" until the last minute. Everything kept changing, I felt like&amp;nbsp;I only had one guarantee and that was my photographer, Christopher. ZulusPro was there for my husband and&amp;nbsp;I from the beginning! My hair stylist cancelled on me 2 months before the wedding, my makeup artist cancelled the month before, my flowers weren&#039;t on island and&amp;nbsp;I wasn&#039;t sure if they would ever be. Through all of this, I would call Chris to make sure he would be there. \"Call\" is an understatement. I&amp;nbsp;harassed him, bombarded him with calls and he was there for me every single time. It was a pleasure doing business with ZulusPro before we even made it to the wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;The day of the wedding the Zuluspro team, didn&#039;t just arrive on time, they arrived early. The pictures told our wedding story from start to finish. The difference between a picture taker and an amazing photographer is passion. This photographer is passionate about his artwork and it is artwork. With Zuluspro you will not get the&amp;nbsp;mundane&amp;nbsp;cookie cutter pictures; your photo album will be&amp;nbsp;uniquely yours.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;\u200bNeither my husband nor I enjoy taking pictures. We wish we had more pictures, but not quite enough to take them. When&amp;nbsp;I took pictures at other&#039;s weddings it always felt forced, awkward, and a little fake. My wedding pictures were none of those things.&amp;nbsp;If I sound like&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m bragging, it&#039;s because&amp;nbsp;I am. This photographer took candid pictures that were in the moment, natural, and told a story with just an image. My heart flutters and I get to experience all the emotions all over again when I look at our album. And the posing pictures that&amp;nbsp;I was so terrified of, were my favorite part!&amp;nbsp;I never even had a chance to feel awkward. Chris started with candid photos and&amp;nbsp;before&amp;nbsp;I knew it I was&amp;nbsp;draping my arm over the back of a chair and doing my best \"Coco&amp;nbsp;Chanel\" pose.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;The Zulus team captured our secret smiles, our stolen kisses,&amp;nbsp;and all the emotions that went into those special moments.&amp;nbsp;\u200bThe smiles my husband and&amp;nbsp;I shared in the photos were never forced. If Chris ever wanted us to smile, he wouldn&#039;t say, \"ok now smile at each other.\" He would ask my husband to tell us a joke and everyone would smile with ease. It was exactly what&amp;nbsp;I wanted!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;Zuluspro is most definitely the best priced, most professional, artistic, and natural photography one will find! We are so lucky to have found them! If any bride out there has any questions about my experience, please feel free to ask!&amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t say enough!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;Thank you ZulusPro, you captured memories and emotions that will last forever!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;courier new&#039;, courier, monospace;\"&gt;-The Hardings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36859,"Name":"ZPP_1164.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-95628900-1503177847.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-95628900-1503177847_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36860,"Name":"ZPP_0679.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-01611200-1503178090.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-01611200-1503178090_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":36862,"Name":"ZPP_1229.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-25825700-1503178708.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-25825700-1503178708_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36865,"Name":"ZPP_0872.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-42528200-1503179240.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2017\/post-289261-0-42528200-1503179240_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667}],"Id":1918085,"PostDate":1503179419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">A picture is worth a thousand words, so before I praise Christopher at ZulusPro with more than a thousand words, I\u00a0implore future brides to go to his website and experience his artwork for themselves.\u00a0<span  style=\"color:#000080\"><a href='http:\/\/www.zulusproweddings.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.zulusproweddings.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">Nothing is more stressful than planning a wedding. Every bride wants \"their\" day to be perfect and although we go through every obstacle to try to make it perfect, there's no\u00a0guarantee. The details of my wedding felt \"up in the air\" until the last minute. Everything kept changing, I felt like\u00a0I only had one guarantee and that was my photographer, Christopher. ZulusPro was there for my husband and\u00a0I from the beginning! My hair stylist cancelled on me 2 months before the wedding, my makeup artist cancelled the month before, my flowers weren't on island and\u00a0I wasn't sure if they would ever be. Through all of this, I would call Chris to make sure he would be there. \"Call\" is an understatement. I\u00a0harassed him, bombarded him with calls and he was there for me every single time. It was a pleasure doing business with ZulusPro before we even made it to the wedding.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">The day of the wedding the Zuluspro team, didn't just arrive on time, they arrived early. The pictures told our wedding story from start to finish. The difference between a picture taker and an amazing photographer is passion. This photographer is passionate about his artwork and it is artwork. With Zuluspro you will not get the\u00a0mundane\u00a0cookie cutter pictures; your photo album will be\u00a0uniquely yours.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">\u200bNeither my husband nor I enjoy taking pictures. We wish we had more pictures, but not quite enough to take them. When\u00a0I took pictures at other's weddings it always felt forced, awkward, and a little fake. My wedding pictures were none of those things.\u00a0If I sound like\u00a0I'm bragging, it's because\u00a0I am. This photographer took candid pictures that were in the moment, natural, and told a story with just an image. My heart flutters and I get to experience all the emotions all over again when I look at our album. And the posing pictures that\u00a0I was so terrified of, were my favorite part!\u00a0I never even had a chance to feel awkward. Chris started with candid photos and\u00a0before\u00a0I knew it I was\u00a0draping my arm over the back of a chair and doing my best \"Coco\u00a0Chanel\" pose.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">The Zulus team captured our secret smiles, our stolen kisses,\u00a0and all the emotions that went into those special moments.\u00a0\u200bThe smiles my husband and\u00a0I shared in the photos were never forced. If Chris ever wanted us to smile, he wouldn't say, \"ok now smile at each other.\" He would ask my husband to tell us a joke and everyone would smile with ease. It was exactly what\u00a0I wanted!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">Zuluspro is most definitely the best priced, most professional, artistic, and natural photography one will find! We are so lucky to have found them! If any bride out there has any questions about my experience, please feel free to ask!\u00a0I can't say enough!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">Thank you ZulusPro, you captured memories and emotions that will last forever!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;\">-The Hardings<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seeingred451@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.84.198.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1503168943,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Seeingred451","Id":289261,"Name":"Seeingred451","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
